"6376","Affaan ne hamein hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Saleem-bin-hayyaan ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Saeed-bin-Mina ne Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : meri aur) mujh se pahley) anbiya (Alaihissalam) ki misal us shakhs ki tarah hai jisne aik ghar banaya aur aik eent ki jagah ke siwa us ( sarey ghar ( ko pura kar diya. aur achi tarah mukammal kar diya. log usmein dakhil hotey , us (ki khoobsoorti) par hairaan hotey aur kehtey : kaash! ! us eent ki jagah (khali) na hoti ! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya is eent ki jagah (ko pur karne wala ( main hun. main aaya to anbiya (Alaihissalam) ke silsiley ko mukammal kar diya."
