"6456","Aamir bin Sad-bin-abi-Waqas ne kaha : maine apne ghulam Naafe ke hath Hazrat Jaabir bin Samra (Raziallahu anhu) ko khat bheja ke aap mujhey koi aisi cheez bataein. jo aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni ho, unhon-ne mujhey (jawab mein) likha : maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna hai. main hauz par (tumhara) pesh-ro hunga."
"6457","Aamir bin Sad-bin-abi-Waqas ne kaha : maine apne ghulam Naafe ke hath Hazrat Jaabir bin Samra (Raziallahu anhu) ko khat bheja ke aap mujhey koi aisi cheez bataein. jo aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni ho, unhon-ne mujhey (jawab mein) likha : maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna hai. main hauz par (tumhara) pesh-ro hunga."
"6458","Misar ne Sad bin Ibrahim se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Sad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Uhud ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke daain aur baain 2 aadmiyon ko dekha wo safaid libaas mein they, unko na maine us se pahley kabhi dekha tha na baad mein yani Hazrat Jibreel (Alaihissalam) aur Mikaail (Alaihissalam) ko."
"6459","Misar ne Sad bin Ibrahim se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Sad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine Uhud ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke daain aur baain 2 aadmiyon ko dekha wo safaid libaas mein they, unko na maine us se pahley kabhi dekha tha na baad mein yani Hazrat Jibreel (Alaihissalam) aur Mikaail (Alaihissalam) ko."
